 (1,"Which ANPT resource is the Evaluation Database to Guide Effectiveness?",["CPG","EDGE documents","JNPT","HOAC-II"],1,"EDGE = Evaluation Database to Guide Effectiveness; documents exist for PD, MS, TBI, SCI, stroke and vestibular disorders."),
 (1,"Which is person-first language?",["The stroke patient","A person with Parkinson disease","A TBI","The spastic arm"],1,"Person-first language is standard in journals and government documents, though some communities (e.g., Deaf) prefer not to use it."),
