 (2,"Which is NOT one of the 6 ANPT core tasks?",["Sit to stand","Step up/down","Rolling","Reach, grasp and manipulate"],2,"Core tasks: sitting, sit to stand, standing, walking with a turn, step up/down, reach/grasp/manipulate."),
